commit 3f2a1b7c9d8e4f6a2b5c7d8e9f0a1b2c3d4e5f6a
Author: Example Dev <dev@example.com>
Date:   Mon Jan 1 00:00:00 2025 +0000

    Fix systemd D-Bus channel deadlock

    The systemd manager goroutine could block forever when trying to
    send a UnitState change on the status channel while the main
    event loop was simultaneously waiting for a D-Bus method call.
    Reorder the send to happen before the D-Bus call and make the
    channel buffered.

